    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41624" root="وثب" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُبَةٌ</span></b>  <i>An assembly; a company; a troop; a
congregated body.</i> (K.) [But it seems rather
to belong to the root <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثبى</span>, as remarked by
Freytag; or, accord. to some, to art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثوب</span>. See
arts. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثبى</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثوب</span>.]

